# What `nerd deploy` leaves behind when it sends the project to be built: what is only this machine's, and everything
# the Dockerfile builds for itself or does not need (the build takes Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/, roms/, scripts/
# and web/). The test fixtures are in a cache outside the repository (scripts/fixture) and never reach it.
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.env
target
out
node_modules
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/src/emulator/zx.wasm
docs
